{"id":"n49095-1-17","stage":1,"title":"웃음 · 笑的行为","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49095-1-17-1","ko":"내 얘기가 그렇게 재미있어?","zh":"我讲的话有那么有趣吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얘기가","meaning":"谈话，说话","explanation":"얘기：谈话，说话；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재미있어?","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc","term":"얘기","zh":"谈话，说话","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3","entryId":"74194","definition":"向某人诉说与某事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等有关的话。","pronunciation":["얘ː기"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/719d71177719b8712111.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49095-1-17-2","ko":"응, 웃음이 그치질 않네.","zh":"嗯，一直笑个不停呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웃음이","meaning":"笑的行为；或指笑的样子或声音。","explanation":"웃음：笑的行为；或指笑的样子或声音。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"웃음","audio":"/audio/4f5bbfbe21d3bba84177.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49095","senseId":"1","lemma":"웃음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그치질","meaning":"停止，结束","explanation":"그치다：停止，结束；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"그치다","audio":"/audio/d2e1c5743fe04efc2512.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29775","senseId":"1","lemma":"그치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않네.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"4f5bbfbe21d3bba8","term":"웃음","zh":"笑的行为；或指笑的样子或声音。","audio":"/audio/4f5bbfbe21d3bba84177.mp3","entryId":"49095","definition":"笑的行为；或指笑的样子或声音。","pronunciation":["우슴"]},{"id":"d2e1c5743fe04efc","term":"그치다","zh":"停止，结束","audio":"/audio/d2e1c5743fe04efc2512.mp3","entryId":"29775","definition":"一直持续的事情、动作、现象等不再继续，停下来。","pronunciation":["그치다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9946d8e60f5fecfbd6ec.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.792,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49095","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":31,"sequenceScore":1.3441,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，一直笑个不停呢。","我讲的话有那么有趣吗？","怎么这么早就起床了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我讲的话有那么有趣吗？","怎么这么早就起床了？","嗯，一直笑个不停呢。"],"answer":2}]}
